      "trackName": "Mini Basketball – Watch Game",
      "description": "Mini Basketball is a fast and fun arcade basketball game designed for Watch.\n\nSwipe to launch the ball, aim carefully, and score through moving hoops.\nCollect bonus points, protect your lives, and try to set a new best score every run.\n\nFeatures:\n\nSimple swipe-to-shoot controls\nQuick, addictive arcade gameplay\nBonus scoring and combo moments\nBest score tracking\nSmooth performance on Watch\nPerfect for short play sessions anytime.",
